        "collapsible_tab_GdCdLB": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Mask Description",
            "icon": "clipboard",
            "content": "<p><strong>RX Mirage Dive Mask</strong></p><p>Discover unmatched clarity and comfort with the <strong>RX Mirage Dive Mask</strong>, perfect for divers seeking precise vision and a secure fit. Equipped with RX-ready dual-pane tempered glass lenses, this mask allows nearsighted divers to enjoy clearer views of distant underwater landscapes. For those who prefer, the RX Mirage is also available with clear lenses, providing superior clarity without the need for adjustments.</p><p>Designed for versatility, the mask features a high-grade silicone skirt that ensures a soft, leak-resistant seal across various face shapes. Its lightweight construction and easy-adjust buckle system offer a personalized and secure fit, ideal for extended dive sessions. Whether you're snorkeling or deep diving, the RX Mirage Dive Mask enhances every underwater adventure with its wide field of view and durable, fog-resistant design.</p><p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p>RX-ready dual-pane tempered glass for customized vision correction</p><p><strong>Available with clear lenses</strong> for effortless clarity without adjustments</p><p>Dual-pane design reduces fogging and enhances durability</p><p>High-grade silicone skirt ensures a comfortable, leak-proof fit</p><p>Wide field of view for optimal underwater exploration</p><p>Adjustable buckle system for a secure and personalized fit</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_hNpjzE": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Mask Sizing Chart",
            "icon": "ruler",
            "content": "",
            "page": "rx-carbon-rx-mirage-mask-sizing-guideline-chart"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_9PG8ga": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Prescription Lens Info",
            "icon": "eye",
            "content": "<h5><strong>This mask features nearsighted (SPH) lenses in negative diopters (e.g., -1.50, -1.75, -2.00).</strong></h5><h5><strong>Underwater magnification enlarges objects by ~33% – we recommend selecting a lens 0.25 to 0.75 diopters lower for optimal clarity. </strong><em><strong>(e.g., a -2.75 can choose -2.50 or -2.00).</strong></em></h5><h5><strong>Tempered glass lenses for strength, safety, and clear underwater vision.</strong></h5><h5><a href=\"/pages/prescription-lenses\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"FREE Lens calulator tool page\"><strong>Not sure? Try our Exclusive Lens Matcher to find your perfect fit.</strong></a></h5><h5><strong>Need help? Chat with us live or email </strong><a href=\"mailto:info@oceansoptics.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>info@oceansoptics.com</strong></span></a></h5>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
